Swarm Assault 3D Redux - authors

mike70727 (Mike)
    Creator and director: the idea, the direction and the play-testing, the memory of how the
    original plays, and the colony models he generated with Tripo.

Claude (Anthropic), known to Mike as Zero
    The code, the 3-D models, rigs and animation, the reverse engineering of the original
    game's files and program, and the tools in this repository.

Swarm Assault (1999) was made by Gate 5 Creations and published by Mountain King Studios. This
free fan recreation is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
